{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50268","headline":"寄麻姑山喻供奉 · 李翔","name":"寄麻姑山喻供奉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽客乘风下九天，拨云亲自拣林泉。\n檐吞海魄迎真气，路绕岩根谒古仙。\n道豚（遁）早爲三洞伏，（项云「豚」应作「胜」，因「胜」字别体作「𬛊」而误\n）诗成曾被六宫传。\n如今万事皆轻弃，只待还丹驻鹤年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李翔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}